nt via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[165,"`href` turns the Card into a native link. Modifier-click, middle-click, and \"Open in new tab\" work\non the surface. Body text is not selectable. Do not put CornerActions on an `href` Card. Clicking\nbody text on an `onPress` or selection Card activates it; dragging that text selects it."],[781,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[685,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[166,"`isDisabled` disables only the primary. `isSelectionDisabled` disables only selection. Radio\nread-only belongs on `RadioGroup`."],[1837,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[1972,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[714,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[1971,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[749,"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."],[120,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[412,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[852,"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened from several places at once."],[848,"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."],[159,"`onPress` is the Card primary. Nested buttons keep their own hits, so Save does no